---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
import { company } from "../data/site";
const updated = new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-GB', { year:'numeric', month:'long', day:'numeric' });
const ADDRESS = "75 King William Street, London EC4N 7BE";
const PHONE = "0330 335 4444";
const CO_NUMBER = "07444390";
---
<Base title="Terms & Conditions — Keybridge IT" description="The terms governing use of the Keybridge IT website.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="LEGAL" title="Terms & Conditions" lead={`Last updated ${updated}. These terms govern your use of our website.`} />
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap legal">

    <p>These terms and conditions govern your use of the website operated by {company.name} ("Keybridge", "we", "us" or "our"). By accessing or using this website, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree with them, please do not use the website.</p>

    <h2>About us</h2>
    <p>This website is operated by {company.name}, a company registered in England and Wales under company number {CO_NUMBER}, with its registered office at {ADDRESS}. You can contact us at {company.email} or on {PHONE}.</p>

    <h2>Use of this website</h2>
    <p>This website is provided for general information about our services. You may view, download and print content from the site for your own internal and non-commercial use only. You agree to use the website lawfully and not to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>use it in any way that breaches applicable laws or regulations;</li>
      <li>attempt to gain unauthorised access to the website, its servers or any connected systems;</li>
      <li>introduce malicious code, or otherwise interfere with the proper working of the website; or</li>
      <li>copy, reproduce or redistribute content except as expressly permitted in these terms.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>All content on this website, including text, graphics, logos, designs and code, is owned by or licensed to {company.name} and is protected by intellectual property laws. You may not reproduce, distribute or use any part of it for commercial purposes without our prior written permission.</p>

    <h2>Information on the website</h2>
    <p>The content on this website is provided for general information only and does not constitute professional, technical or legal advice. While we take care to keep the information accurate and up to date, we make no representations or warranties that it is complete, current or error-free. Any reliance you place on the content is at your own risk.</p>

    <h2>Our services</h2>
    <p>Nothing on this website constitutes an offer to provide services, and the website does not create any contractual relationship for the supply of services. Where we agree to provide services to you, those services are governed by a separate written agreement between us, which will take precedence over these website terms.</p>

    <h2>Links to other websites</h2>
    <p>This website may contain links to third-party websites. We provide these links for convenience only and have no control over, and accept no responsibility for, the content, availability or practices of those websites. A link does not imply our endorsement.</p>

    <h2>Availability of the website</h2>
    <p>We aim to keep the website available and working correctly, but we do not guarantee that it will be uninterrupted, secure or error-free. We may suspend, withdraw or change all or any part of the website without notice. We will not be liable to you if the website is unavailable at any time.</p>

    <h2>Our liability</h2>
    <p>Nothing in these terms excludes or limits our liability for death or personal injury caused by our negligence, for fraud or fraudulent misrepresentation, or for any other liability that cannot lawfully be excluded or limited.</p>
    <p>Subject to that, we will not be liable for any indirect or consequential loss, or for any loss of profit, revenue, business, goodwill or data, arising from your use of, or inability to use, this website. Our total liability arising from your use of the website is limited to the fullest extent permitted by law.</p>

    <h2>Privacy and cookies</h2>
    <p>Your use of this website is also governed by our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="/cookies">Cookie Policy</a>, which explain how we handle personal data and use cookies.</p>

    <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
    <p>We may revise these terms from time to time. The date at the top of this page shows when they were last updated. Your continued use of the website after any change means you accept the revised terms.</p>

    <h2>Governing law</h2>
    <p>These terms and any dispute arising from them are governed by the laws of England and Wales, and the courts of England and Wales will have exclusive jurisdiction.</p>

    <h2>Contact us</h2>
    <p>For any questions about these terms, contact us at {company.email}, call {PHONE}, or write to us at {ADDRESS}.</p>

  </div></section>
</Base>
<style>
  .legal{max-width:72ch}
  .legal h2{font-size:1.4rem;margin:38px 0 12px;color:var(--ink, #fff)}
  .legal p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:14px}
  .legal ul{margin:0 0 16px 22px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75}
  .legal li{margin-bottom:8px}
  .legal a{color:var(--teal, #1fb6c9);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px}
  .legal strong{color:#e7e7ee;font-weight:600}
</style>
